<title>USA: Substance Abuse Technologies names CFO.</title>
<headline>Substance Abuse Technologies names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Substance Abuse Technologies Inc said Tuesday it had named Robert Muccini chief financial officer, replacing Dennis Wittman, who remained in California, following the company's relocation to Florida.</p>
<p>Substance Abuse Technologies offers customized loss prevention and risk management services with special emphasis on workplace substance abuse issues.</p>
